              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Mfalme atawaambia wale walioko katika mkono wake wa kulia, Njooni, mliobarikiwa na Baba yangu, urithini ufalme mliowekewa tayari tangu kuumbwa ulimwengu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
